{title: Thandi Hawayein Lehrake Aaye}
{artist: Lata Mangeshkar S D Burman}
{key: E}

{c: Verse 1}
[E]Thahndi hawaaen, laharaake [A]aayen,        Rut hai [E]jawaan,tumako [B]yahaan
kaise [E]bulaayen,        [E]Chaand aur taaren,hanste [B]nazaare
Milake [A]sabhi dil men [B]sakhi,        jaadu [E]jagaayen
[E]Kaha bhi na jaae,raha bhi na [B]jaye,        Tumase [A]agar mile bhi [B]nazar,
ham jhenp [E]jaaen,        [E]Dil ke fasaane, dil bhi n [B]jaane
Tumako [A]sajan dil ki [B]lagan,        kaise [E]bataaen
